# 11. GIT INTEGRATION

Implement safe Git operations.

Every task must have its own branch.

Suggested naming:

hcaliper/task-{task-id}

Before execution:

- Check the repository state.
- Identify uncommitted user changes.
- Never overwrite or discard user changes.
- Ensure the task branch is isolated.
- Record the base commit.

After execution:

- Generate a diff.
- Validate the changes.
- Record commit information.
- Preserve rejected execution artifacts.

Do not automatically merge into the default branch.

Support GitHub Pull Request creation where configured.

Merging requires an authorized approval process.

